[en.FOCUS_C12_TAKE_BACK_TREE_OF_HARMONY]
Take back the Tree of Harmony

[en.FOCUS_C12_TAKE_BACK_TREE_OF_HARMONY_desc]
My sister, Pinkie Pie, and Applejack of the Apple family were both bearers of the Elements of Harmony, which was one of the reasons they fell victim to Cozy Glow’s schemes. The Tree of Harmony is their precious legacy, and I cannot stand by while it is controlled by others. If I desire it, I shall obtain it.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TAKE_BACK_TREE_OF_HARMONY]
夺回谐律树

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TAKE_BACK_TREE_OF_HARMONY_desc]
我的妹妹萍琪派，以及苹果家族的苹果嘉儿都是和谐之元的组成部分，也是她们惨遭可西光辉谋害的重要原因之一。谐律树是她们留下的宝贵遗产，我不该坐视谐律树被把控在其他小马蹄中。只要我想，我就要得到。

